000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TMOVEVEN.
000400 AUTHOR.               BARBARA WINTER.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         AUGUST 1988.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000800*REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM IS A ONE-TIME PROGRAM DESIGNED TO
000900*                      MOVE DATA FROM THE OLD DETAIL MASTER 'DVENDOR'
001000*                      TO THE NEW KSAM FILE 'DVENDORS'.
001100*
001200*
001300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
001600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
001700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001800 FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT DVENDOR
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

003400     SELECT KVENDOR-FILE  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSVEND
003500       ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
003600       ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
003700       RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
004000       STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
002400

       DATA DIVISION.
003600 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DVENDOR
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDOR-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0700  OF MCFLCS0701.
004300 FD  KVENDOR-FILE.
004400 01  KVENDOR-RECORD.
004500     COPY DDS-MCRPCSVEND OF MCFLCSVEND.

003200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003300 77  ERROR-SW                    PIC X(3)  VALUE "YES".
003400
003500 01  FILE-STATUS.
003600     05  FILE-STAT1              PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
003700     05  FILE-STAT2              PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
003900
004000 COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYCSIS.
004200 COPY DATAB   OF COPYCSIS.
004600 COPY DVENDOR   OF COPYCSIS.
004800 COPY VCOMAREA  OF COPYCSIS.
004900
005000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
005100
005200 001-BEGIN SECTION.
005300
005400 010-MAINLINE.
005500     PERFORM 100-BEGIN.
005600     PERFORM 200-MOVE-DATA THRU 299-EXIT.
005700     PERFORM 1000-CLOSE-FILES.
005800     GOBACK.
005900
006000 100-BEGIN.
006100     MOVE SPACES TO BU-DISPLAY-AREA.
006200     OPEN OUTPUT KVENDOR-FILE.
006300     OPEN INPUT DVENDOR.
006900
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDOR FIRST INTO BUF-DVENDOR
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
007000 200-MOVE-DATA.
007100
007400     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
007500        GO TO 299-EXIT.
007600     IF VEN-ITM-NO = 0
007700        MOVE VEN-ITM-DATA        TO KVENNAME
007800        MOVE VEN-VEN-CODE        TO KVENCDE
              MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD
              WRITE KVENDOR-RECORD
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
008100
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDOR NEXT  INTO BUF-DVENDOR
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
008200     GO TO 200-MOVE-DATA.
008300 299-EXIT.  EXIT.
008400
008500************************************************************
008600*                    B L O W U P                           *
008700*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
008800*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
008900*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
009000*                                                          *
009100*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
009200*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
009300*                                                          *
009400*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
009500************************************************************
009600 990-BLOWUP.
009700     MOVE "TMOVEVEN"   TO BU-PGM-NAME.
009800     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
009900     MOVE BUF-DVENDOR   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
010000     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
010100           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
010200           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
010300 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
010400
010500 1000-CLOSE-FILES.
010600     CLOSE DVENDOR.
010800     CLOSE KVENDOR-FILE.
